---
// /educators was the first address of the doctors-who-teach test page (21 Oct 2026).
// A plain redirect would drop the ?utm_source=test tag the page reads, so this
// small page forwards with the query string and hash kept. The page's internal
// tag and calendar keep the name "educators" on purpose.
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Redirecting</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://synchrosocial.com/doctors-who-teach" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/doctors-who-teach" />
    <script is:inline>
      location.replace("/doctors-who-teach" + location.search + location.hash);
    </script>
  </head>
  <body><a href="/doctors-who-teach">Continue</a></body>
</html>
